   "quote": "NIR spectra (780-2500 nm) contain predominantly overtones and component bands of fundamental vibrations of molecules and atomic groups, such as -OH, -NH2=NH, -CH3, =CH2, ≥CH, etc., found in many organic and inorganic compounds.",
